+# Split an amount (more than 0.00, less than the claim's) off an OPEN claim: it keeps the rest and loses any figure a statement bound it to; a new OPEN claim with the split-off amount, the same date and note, the next number, opened by the user, its due-by fixed now and the original's number as its split-from, is added under the person. A refused split (not OPEN, deferred, an amount out of range, unknown claim, a claim dated in a closed period) writes nothing, not even an audit line.
